(나) $|\mathrm{Ph}_k(z)|\le rac{n+1}{3k}\cdot rac{|z|^3}{\sqrt k}$이고, $z\ge0$에서 $\mathrm{Ph}_k(z)- rac23 rac{z^3}{\sqrt k}\in k^{-3/2} igl[ rac{
u+1}3z^3- rac{n+1}{5k}z^5,\  rac{
