(다) Robbins의 부등식(Robbins, *A remark on Stirling's formula*, Amer. Math. Monthly 62 (1955) 26–29)으로 $\sqrt{2\pi}(n+1)^{3/2}\le n!e^{n+1}/(n+1)^{n-1}\le\sqrt{2\pi}(n+1)^{3/2}e^{1/(12(n+1))}$이므로 $\mathsf n_k/\mathsf n_\infty\in igl[((n+1)/(2k))^{3/2},\ ((n+1)/(2k))^{3/2}e^{1/(12(n+1))} igr]\subset[1,\exp((3(
u+1)/4+1/24)/k)]$다. 또 $\mathrm{Bn}_k=\mathrm{Bor}(k)\,\mathsf n_kk^{3/2}\le(2\pi)^{-1/2}\mathsf n_k$다.

